---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Redmond Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Redmond, OR</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SEO consulting for Redmond, Oregon businesses that want stronger local rankings, better search visibility, improved website structure, and more qualified leads." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">Redmond Oregon SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO services for Redmond businesses ready to get found by more local customers.</h1>
          <p>
            I help Redmond businesses improve their websites, local search presence, content, and
            organic visibility so more people can find them when they are ready to act.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Local Search Visibility</h2>
              <p>
                Build a stronger presence for Redmond searches, nearby Central Oregon terms, and service
                keywords that matter to your business.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>SEO Website Cleanup</h2>
              <p>
                Fix weak metadata, thin pages, unclear headings, poor internal links, and technical
                issues that can hold your site back.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Content That Supports Growth</h2>
              <p>
                Create useful service pages, local pages, and supporting content built around what your
                customers are already searching for.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>SEO consulting for Redmond, Oregon businesses</h2>
          <p>
            Redmond continues to grow, and so does the competition in search. Businesses that show up
            clearly in Google, map results, and local organic results have a better chance of getting
            calls, form fills, bookings, and walk-ins.
          </p>

          <p>
            I help businesses improve the parts of SEO that actually move the needle: better pages,
            cleaner site structure, stronger local signals, useful content, and reporting that connects
            search performance to business outcomes.
          </p>

          <h2>SEO services for Redmond companies</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Local SEO strategy for Redmond and Central Oregon</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile optimization guidance</li>
            <li>Technical SEO reviews</li>
            <li>Keyword research for services and local demand</li>
            <li>Title tag and meta description improvements</li>
            <li>Service page and location page recommendations</li>
            <li>Content planning for organic traffic growth</li>
            <li>SEO reporting focused on leads and revenue</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Built for practical business growth</h2>
          <p>
            SEO should not feel like a mystery. I focus on clear recommendations, simple priorities, and
            work that helps your business earn more qualified visibility. That might mean improving your
            existing pages, creating new pages, cleaning up technical issues, or building a stronger
            local search plan.
          </p>

          <h2>Central Oregon search experience</h2>
          <p>
            Redmond businesses often compete across both Redmond and Bend-area searches. I can help map
            out where your business should focus, which pages you need, and how to avoid spreading your
            site too thin.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Me About Redmond SEO</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
